~ start
Hello, there!\nGlad to meet you![icon]
Welcome to the world of POKéMON![icon]
My name is OAK.[icon]
People affectionately refer to me\nas the POKéMON PROFESSOR.[icon]
do show_pokeball()
This world...[next=0.4]
=> END
~ send
...is inhabited far and wide by\ncreatures called POKéMON.[icon]
For some people, POKéMON are pets.\nOthers use them for battling.[icon]
As for myself...[icon]
I study POKéMON as a profession.[icon]
=> END
~ call
But first, tell me a little about\nyourself.[icon]
=> END
~ gender
Now tell me. Are you a boy?\nOr are you a girl?
- BOY
	do set_player_texture(Constants.GENDER.MALE)
- GIRL
	do set_player_texture(Constants.GENDER.FEMALE)
=> END
~ name
Let's begin with your name.\nWhat is it?[icon]
=> END
~ confirm
Right...\nSo your name is {{player_name}}.[halignment=left][valignment=top]
- YES
- NO
	set current_action_index = 7
=> END
~ rival
This is my grandson.[icon]
He's been your rival since you both\nwere babies.[icon]
=> END
~ rival_name
if rival_name != ""
	Your rival's name, what was it now?[halignment=left][valignment=center]
else
	...Erm, what was his name now?[halignment=left][valignment=center]
- NEW NAME
	do input_rival_name()
- GREEN
	set rival_name = "GREEN"
- GARY
	set rival_name = "GARY"
- KAZ
	set rival_name = "KAZ"
- TORU
	set rival_name = "TORU"
=> END
~ rival_confirm
...Er, was it {{rival_name}}?[halignment=left][valignment=top]
- YES
	=> rival_confirmed
- NO
	set current_action_index = 18
=> END
~ rival_confirmed
That's right! I remember now!\nHis name is {{rival_name}}![icon]
=> END
~ intro_end
{{player_name}}![icon]
Your very own POKéMON legend is\nabout to unfold![icon]
A world of dreams and adventures\nwith POKéMON awaits! Let's go![next=0.5]
=> END